# SMEvolve

## Prompt 029 — Admin Portal Command Center, Analytics & Security Monitoring

**Project:** SMEvolve
**Module:** Admin Portal
**Purpose:** Redesign the existing Admin Portal into a unified administrative command center with integrated analytics, AI management, audit monitoring, and security notifications.

---

