# 56. FAILURE HANDLING

If email delivery fails:

The underlying administrator action must not necessarily fail.

Example:

```text
Password changed
       ↓
Audit event recorded
       ↓
Email attempt fails
       ↓
Notification failure logged
```

Do not prevent a legitimate password change merely because an email could not be delivered.

